CelesTrak GP/OMM data
---------------------

The bundled orbital catalog in StarCatch/Resources/catalog.json is generated
from CelesTrak GP/OMM data. StarCatch does not claim authorship of the source
orbital records.

Source: https://celestrak.org/
Usage policy: https://celestrak.org/usage-policy.php
GP data documentation:
https://celestrak.org/NORAD/documentation/gp-data-formats.php

The catalog update script is intended for release-time use only. Consumers
that refresh the data should follow CelesTrak's current query documentation,
download-frequency guidance, and other applicable source terms.
